DATASET DISCLAIMER
==================

This repository does NOT include the dataset. The dataset used in this project
is the El Salvador Global School-based Student Health Survey (GSHS) 2013,
made available by the World Health Organization (WHO).

  Source code: MIT License (see above)
  Dataset:
    WHO NCD Microdata Repository
    Not redistributed with this repository.
    Use subject to WHO terms and conditions.

Dataset source:
  https://extranet.who.int/ncdsmicrodata/index.php/catalog/97

The dataset is the exclusive property of the World Health Organization (WHO)
and the Government of El Salvador. Use of the dataset is subject to the WHO
terms and conditions available at the URL above. You must obtain the data
independently from that source.

The MIT license in this file applies ONLY to the source code in this
repository. It does NOT apply to the dataset and does NOT grant any rights
over the dataset.

Any analysis, findings, or models produced from this code and data do not
constitute official WHO or government health guidance.
